      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Scrape Hiring Intent for Dave\nApify (scheduled daily) posts its run-finished webhook here, then we pull the scraped jobs, drop staffing firms + non-US, dedupe by company via the Seen table, pull ALL execs + eng/R&D decision makers from Supersoniq, and relay every one into the single hiring campaign through the intent-dave pipeline.\n\nBefore activating:\n1. Create n8n credential \"Apify\" (Bearer token from Apify console).\n2. Create n8n credential \"Supersoniq\" (Bearer token) and VERIFY the enrich endpoint URL and response shape on Get Decision Makers.\n3. On Apify: schedule the curious_coder/linkedin-jobs-scraper task daily and add a webhook integration (event ACTOR.RUN.SUCCEEDED) pointing at this webhook URL. First run past month (f_TPR r2592000); daily past 24h (r86400).",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 960,
        "height": 200
      }
    }
